	(text "This is a remake of the never-released V364 prototype computer.\nI started with a schematic of the Plus/4 computer and adapted\nit to my style then layed out the board based on pics of\nexisting V364 motherboards. The speech parts are taken from the\nCommodore Magic Voice cart and modified for the 8706 gate array.\nThe 8706 must be recreated in programmable logic for the speech\nto work. A custom case and keyboard are being designed to\ncomplete the remake."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.986 381 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
